#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:310
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_MayWhoAreYou"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"Who… Who are you?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"Oh, you're {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"So your move was today.\p"
"Um… I'm MAY.\n"
"Glad to meet you!\p"
"I…\n"
"I have this dream of becoming friends\l"
"with POKéMON all over the world.\p"
"I… I heard about you, {PLAYER}{KUN}, from\n"
"my dad, PROF. BIRCH.\p"
"I was hoping that you would be nice,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, and that we could be friends.\p"
"Oh, this is silly, isn't it?\n"
"I… I've just met you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Eheheh…\p"
"Oh, no! I forgot!\p"
"I was supposed to go help Dad catch\n"
"some wild POKéMON!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'll catch you later!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_MayGettingReady"
msgid ""
"POKéMON fully restored!\n"
"Items ready, and…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:338
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_BrendanWhoAreYou"
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"You…\p"
"Who are you?\p"
"Oh, you're {PLAYER}, aren't you?\n"
"Moved in next door, right?\p"
"I didn't know that you're a girl.\p"
"Dad, PROF. BIRCH, said that our new\n"
"next-door neighbor is a GYM LEADER's\l"
"kid, so I assumed you'd be a guy.\p"
"My name's BRENDAN.\n"
"So, hi, neighbor!\p"
"Huh? Hey, {PLAYER}, don't you have\n"
"a POKéMON?\p"
"Do you want me to go catch you one?\p"
"Aw, darn, I forgot…\p"
"I'm supposed to go help my dad catch\n"
"some wild POKéMON.\p"
"Some other time, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_BrendanGettingReady"
msgid ""
"POKéMON fully restored…\n"
"Items all packed, and…$"
