#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:362
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_ItsRivalsPokeBall"
msgid ""
"It's {RIVAL}'s POKé BALL!\p"
"Better leave it right where it is.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_MayJustCheckingMyPokedex"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I was just checking my POKéDEX.\p"
"There's still a lot of POKéMON that\n"
"I've seen but haven't caught.\p"
"And there are many others that\n"
"I think will evolve.\p"
"I wonder where I should go catch\n"
"some POKéMON next?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:376
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_MayWhereShouldIGoNext"
msgid ""
"MAY: I wonder where I should go catch\n"
"some POKéMON next?\p"
"Wouldn't it be funny if we ran into each\n"
"other, {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_BrendanJustCheckingMyPokedex"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, it's {PLAYER}.\p"
"I was just checking out my POKéDEX.\p"
"There are still many POKéMON that\n"
"I need to catch, I know, but this\l"
"is looking pretty good.\p"
"Checking this POKéDEX out gives me\n"
"the urge to hit the road again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F/scripts.inc:391
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_2F_Text_BrendanWhereShouldIGoNext"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I'm having a hard time deciding\n"
"where I should catch POKéMON next.\p"
"Hey, {PLAYER}, if I see you while I'm out\n"
"catching POKéMON, I can pitch you a\l"
"battle if you'd like.$"
msgstr ""
